  "title": "Honeywell Technologies Announces Leadership Updates for Process Technology and Building Automation",
  "summary": "Honeywell Technologies announced the appointment of Billal Hammoud as President and CEO of Process Technology, a component of the company’s Process Automation & Technology reportable business segment, effective Oct. 1, 2026. A veteran of Honeywell Technologies, Hammoud will succeed Ken West who is leaving the company to pursue an external opportunity as of Aug. 31, 2026.",
